Verified non-overlapping file sets: no file appears in two phases. The one ordering hazard that is not pure file overlap: Phase 7 deletes `useCheckout.test.ts:1016` and `:1157` (the kiosk-language tests); those cases must exist in `resetKioskSession.test.ts` / `useKioskCheckout.test.ts` (Phase 4) **before or in the same landing** as Phase 7, or kiosk-language coverage is momentarily zero.

**Standing rules for every phase** (from `phases-status.md`, apply uniformly): follow `ic-client/.claude/CLAUDE.md` strictly — no `any`, no `as X` without a justifying comment, explicit `Promise<T>` return types, typed `Error` subclasses (never throw strings), all popups as `Drawer anchor="bottom"` bottom sheets. No `@types/jest`: `import { jest } from "@jest/globals"`; always `const m = jest.fn<TReturn, TArgs>()`; never annotate `let m: jest.Mock<…>` (breaks `tsc`). Reuse before writing new code; port from `ic-pizza-kiosk` including its explanatory comments — do not invent. Backend repo is read-only, no backend changes in scope. Do not commit or push — leave all changes in the working tree. If a requirement turns out ambiguous or depends on something not visible, write `needs-clarification.md` with the exact open questions and STOP — do not guess, do not invent values, do not silently descope.

